  swayAmount: 1
  swaySpeed: 1.1
  useRandomStartOffset: 1
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to our village, you must be the hunter!
  - Let me explain how things work around here.
  - On the left is the quest board, where our villagers post issues that they have.
    Make sure to check often for new quests!
  - On the right is the weaponsmith, where you can upgrade various abilities, with
    a fee of course!
  - If you ever need help, I'll be glad to explain the layout of our village at anytime!
    Take care!
